Modify your electricity plan and rates. Changes take effect immediately and update all cost calculations.

**Tip:** If you've switched plans with OVO, update your selection here to ensure accurate cost tracking and savings calculations.

**Billing cycle:** If your OVO bill doesn't start on the 1st, set the **Billing Cycle Start Day** to the day your cycle begins (e.g. 24 for a 24th–23rd cycle). Month-to-date usage, daily averages and bill estimates then follow your real billing period. Leave it at 1 for a calendar month.

**Free 3 plan:** OVO's API reports your peak/off-peak usage as "Other". Set the peak window hours below to split that usage into peak and off-peak. Leave both at the same value to disable.
